- weights: integers that sum to exactly 100. Default: industry 20, size 15, location 10, need_signals 15,
  function 15, seniority 15, role_type 10. Adjust only if the text clearly justifies it.
- thresholds default: company_fit_min_pct 50, ideal_min_total 75, good_min_total 55, person_fit_min_pct 40.

